101-  /// issue #1761): the 32KB byte budget over AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md and
102-  /// friends, allocated leaf-first. Truncation is never silent on EITHER
103-  /// surface — a head excerpt + read-the-full-file instruction for the
104-  /// model, a dim/AppLog boot notice per truncated or dropped file.
105-  projectContextBudget,
